contentText:
Nearly 30 years after 2Pac was shot and killed in Las Vegas, the rap icon&#8217;s murder trial kicked off with jury selection taking place on Monday (Aug. 10), as Duane “Keffe D” Davis faces a murder charge following his 2023 arrest.

